# Judge caches are versioned because they allow an unchanged evaluation to be
# rerun without new API calls. The cache key is a hash of the generated reply.
# runs/*/*.cache.jsonl remains tracked.
*.cache.jsonl
!runs/*/*.cache.jsonl

# local-only notes between syncs (not for git)
worklog_local.md
docs/DIALOG_SAFETY_NOTE.md

# Old semester reports, kept locally. docs/legacy/Presentation.pptx stays tracked.
docs/legacy/*.pdf
